  "body": "PR #58 committed two UI goldens rendered on another platform; on Windows (where the gates run) they failed on anti-aliasing noise only - 5,248 / 7,145 pixels under threshold 0.4, 1 / 4 past 0.6, none past 1.0; the diff images show isolated pixels, no layout change. Re-rendered both with `UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS=1`; `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib` (CWD crates/ui): 217 passed, 2 ignored.\n\nChangelog: none (test goldens only)\n\nFixes #66",
